Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=58}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.86,0:00:06.11,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,把他們統統打飛吧，凱多。{Z}
Comment: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:07.32,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,{}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:11.28,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,你覺得那五個人\N能活下來幾個？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.58,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,特拉法爾加！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.58,0:00:21.58,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,你不能用你的能力\N把其中一個弄到樓下去嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:23.80,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,要是做得到，我早就做了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:28.13,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,他們的霸氣太強了，我移不動！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:31.34,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,既然這樣，那就把他們大卸八塊吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:38.10,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂！有個大招來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:10.34,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,希望你那把老腰還撐得住，老太婆！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.34,0:01:13.80,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,你以為你在跟誰說話，\N臭小鬼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:24.02,Main-207+,Kaido+Linlin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}– 霸海！\N– 霸海！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.40,0:01:33.28,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\t(1693,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}開什麼玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.41,0:01:35.95,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,{\t(2269,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}不會吧！那個閃不掉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:50.55,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,大家快閃開！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:02.89,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,再這樣下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:05.36,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我們就全都完蛋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.36,0:02:07.57,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:32.63,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,我看不到他們，\N但還聽得見他們的聲音…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:36.09,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,他們一定是逃掉了，真讓我刮目相看。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:40.72,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,索隆，你還活著嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:44.85,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,應該還活著吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:47.61,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,你能擋這麼久，幹得好。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.61,0:02:49.32,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,多謝。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.90,0:02:50.98,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,草帽小子呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.12,0:02:59.37,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.71,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.71,0:03:10.63,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}紅色…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.42,0:03:16.80,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你幹嘛閃啊，凱多？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:19.10,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,是怕會痛嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.73,0:03:32.19,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,痛痛痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.59,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,太好了！燒吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:23.14,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,讓火焰燒得更旺吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.93,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,可惡！火根本壓不下去！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:29.68,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,我們的麻煩已經夠多了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.68,0:05:34.94,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,福祿壽！那些炸藥\N放在哪裡你知道吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.94,0:05:37.32,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,是的，請容我為您帶路。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:41.36,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,到處都燒起來了！這到底是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:45.83,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,去死吧，凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.83,0:05:48.58,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,把你的新鬼島計畫\N一起帶進地獄吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:49.95,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,大蛇！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:52.29,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,這一切都是你搞的鬼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.29,0:05:54.67,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,啊，你們終於現身了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:57.04,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們這些半鬼般的光月家害蟲！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:06:00.38,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們到底是來幹什麼的？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:04.14,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,二十年來，\N你們歷盡了千辛萬苦，
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.14,0:06:06.60,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,如今竟還一路追到了這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.60,0:06:10.43,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們就這麼恨我嗎？\N這麼怨我嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:12.06,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,大蛇大人…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.06,0:06:15.27,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,他們並不知道您已經死過一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:16.73,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,請您快逃吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.73,0:06:18.11,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,由我來收拾他們——
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.11,0:06:20.23,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,別多管閒事，你這蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:23.86,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們一個個都渾身是傷…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:25.62,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,難怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.74,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們根本是自願來送死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:32.58,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們這些人\N肯定是瘋了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.83,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,大蛇！我們可沒空\N浪費在你這種蠢貨身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:36.96,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:38.71,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,要是我不肯呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:39.34,Main-207+,Denjiro,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:58.11,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們知不知道\N自己違抗的到底是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.11,0:07:00.52,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,認清你們的身分，你們這些老鼠！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:03.74,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我可是和之國的將軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.82,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們那是什麼眼神？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.82,0:07:10.37,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我根本沒有錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.62,0:07:15.41,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我只不過是向光月家\N討回他們應得的報應罷了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:18.50,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我只是拿回\N原本被奪走的東西而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.72,0:07:29.39,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,可你們這些蠢材就是不懂！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:33.93,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,無論是百姓還是武士，\N都該向將軍俯首聽命！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:36.19,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,在這裡握有權力的人是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:39.86,Main-207+,Raizo,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}花手裏劍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:46.53,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,這一切都是因為這個國家壓迫了我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:55.29,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,那…那種眼神！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.75,0:08:03.50,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,你們是想說我錯了嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:04.88,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,別那樣看我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.17,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,別那樣看我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:10.34,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,我不可能有錯！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.60,0:08:15.27,Main-207+,Orochi,0,0,0,,別再用那種眼神看我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.07,0:08:27.36,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,大蛇大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:30.57,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,你的懲罰，就到地獄去領受吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.57,0:08:31.37,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,上啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.45,0:08:36.91,Main-207+,Raizo,0,0,0,,你要為你的主公報仇嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:39.67,Main-207+,Raizo,0,0,0,,是我小看你了，福祿壽。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:43.59,Main-207+,Raizo,0,0,0,,他雖然愚蠢，你卻\N至死都對他忠心耿耿。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:46.55,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,這句話我原封不動還給你們！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:51.09,Main-207+,Fukurokuju,0,0,0,,就算我不尋仇，\N你我之間也注定要一戰！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:53.18,Main-207+,Raizo,0,0,0,,你應該明白吧，雷藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.18,0:08:54.18,Main-207+,Raizo,0,0,0,,沒錯！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.22,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:08:59.98,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,這可是你自找的，臭小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.17,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,休想！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.34,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,要上就一起上，我無所謂！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.81,0:09:42.14,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,給他點顏色瞧瞧！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:43.52,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.90,0:09:45.69,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,多謝啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.95,0:09:54.12,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.51,0:10:12.97,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}霸三世…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:19.64,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}拉格納拉克！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:27.06,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.86,0:10:30.07,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,順便把剩下的雜魚也清乾淨吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:35.16,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,準備好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.16,0:10:35.87,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.87,0:10:37.07,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}房間！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:38.53,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}搬運！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:42.83,Main-207+,Zeus,0,0,0,,我在哪裡？！好暗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:44.37,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,宙斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:46.38,Main-207+,Killer,0,0,0,,你搞得定吧，羅羅亞？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:49.50,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,最好是搞得定！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:56.30,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,休想回到她身邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.97,0:11:00.22,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}焰裂：六道之辻！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.73,0:11:06.15,Main-207+,Napoleon,0,0,0,,住手啦！拜託，我只是把刀而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.15,0:11:08.98,Main-207+,Zeus+Prometheus+Napoleon,0,0,0,,– 媽媽，救命！\N– 媽媽，救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:10.07,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,你們這些傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:10.86,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,就是現在！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:12.61,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}龐克·手槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:16.53,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,又想怎樣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.53,0:11:21.49,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,你以為把我們拆散\N就足以打敗我們嗎？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:30.92,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}彈開！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.84,0:11:34.55,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}指揮！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:39.35,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,你這蠢貨！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:41.72,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,你以為一塊石頭就能解決我嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.14,0:11:47.39,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,去死吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:50.86,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.03,0:11:58.24,Main-207+,Zeus,0,0,0,,媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:01.41,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,只要她得不到支援，就少了一個對手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.79,0:12:05.50,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這下你覺得如何？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:11.17,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,快來幫我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.17,0:12:14.17,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,宙斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:18.22,Main-207+,Zeus,0,0,0,,媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:20.64,Main-207+,Zeus,0,0,0,,怎麼了，媽媽？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.64,0:12:22.81,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,媽媽！我這就去——
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.61,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,媽媽！我要——
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.45,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,{\t(1485,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}那個笨蛋…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.08,0:12:54.92,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,他剛才要是把全身骨頭\N都摔碎了我也不意外！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.75,0:12:59.26,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,真是難看啊，莉莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.68,0:13:03.14,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,什麼都得我自己來。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:07.81,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,喂，海賊獵人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:11.19,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,把普羅米修斯放開！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.73,0:13:15.15,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}搬運！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.74,0:13:21.53,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}注射彈！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:28.70,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你的能力還真是古怪得很！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.70,0:13:30.87,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,特拉法爾加！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.87,0:13:32.29,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}帷幕！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.97,0:13:41.43,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.01,Main-207+,Napoleon,0,0,0,,別過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.10,0:13:45.68,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.14,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.51,0:13:49.81,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:57.23,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂，特拉男！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.28,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那邊那個火焰臉…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.69,0:14:02.15,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,打算去救大媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.12,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,隨他去吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.33,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,我寧可這次任務失敗…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.66,0:14:15.13,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,也不願我們之中有人送命。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.30,0:14:26.10,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,我們的目的\N只是把大媽和凱多拆開而已！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:31.02,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,沒必要拿命去拼！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.06,0:14:39.19,Main-207+,Kid,0,0,0,,大媽就交給我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.91,0:14:47.83,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,好險！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:50.54,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,太好了，媽媽你沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.50,0:14:57.21,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,你可真是貼心啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:15:00.42,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,普羅米修斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.34,0:15:03.30,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,不像{\i1}某人{\i0}那樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:06.72,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,宙斯到底在搞什麼鬼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:09.10,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,沒用的呆瓜！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.31,0:15:13.10,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.10,0:15:15.81,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,完全同意，媽媽！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.48,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,他老是笨手笨腳，還總是拖拖拉拉。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.48,0:15:21.23,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,說得太對了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.11,0:15:27.20,Main-207+,Prometheus,0,0,0,,對了，媽媽，我有件事想拜託你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.12,Main-207+,Linlin,0,0,0,,什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.60,0:15:53.06,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你看看草帽小子那張臉！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.39,0:15:57.39,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,跟上次一模一樣。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.39,0:16:01.36,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,他都昏過去了，卻還…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:04.94,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,還在瞪著我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.91,0:16:09.87,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,該不該先從那雙眼睛…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:13.08,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,開始捏爆呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:16.29,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,還是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:17.87,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,先捏他的腦袋？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.42,0:16:20.63,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,又或者是他的心臟？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:22.59,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,特拉男。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:27.34,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我接下來要做的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.89,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,會把我逼到極限。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:31.60,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,索隆？！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.97,0:16:34.31,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,在這裡拖下去…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:36.77,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,只會不斷消耗我們。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:41.15,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,要是這一招不管用…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:43.07,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那就是我們的死期到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.48,0:16:44.82,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,這一擊之後…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:47.86,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,就全靠你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:01.33,Main-207+,Zeus,0,0,0,,喂，凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.55,0:17:09.13,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那可是我們的船長！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.84,0:17:13.89,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你何不先試著…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.43,0:17:17.68,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,捏爆{\i1}我的{\i0}腦袋看看？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.98,0:17:24.98,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鬼氣九刀流！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.03,0:17:29.15,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}阿修羅！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.11,0:17:31.91,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}拔刀！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:55.97,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}九刀流！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:17.83,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}阿修羅·拔刀…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.45,0:18:21.04,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}死者遊戲！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:51.15,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.20,0:18:57.91,Thoughts-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,這小子…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:00.66,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,難不成…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:02.83,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你也擁有霸王色霸氣？！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.83,0:19:06.79,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你在說什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:11.42,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,我聽不懂你的意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:17.80,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,那可是…我的必殺技啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.52,0:19:25.60,Main-207+,Zoro,0,0,0,,你要是好歹倒下去…\N那也就值了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.40,0:19:29.11,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你已經做得夠好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.11,0:19:31.69,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,這道傷疤會永遠留著。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:43.50,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,現在這些年輕人啊，我跟你說…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:52.17,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,喂！索隆，快逃！
Comment: 0,0:19:57.22,0:20:02.22,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,Don't bother approaching me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:19:58.84,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,不必費那個勁。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.47,0:20:02.22,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,我自己過去找你就好。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:06.02,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}雷鳴八卦！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:32.46,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,真是可惜…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.46,0:20:36.38,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,只要你肯跟我走，\N我們本可以稱霸世界的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:38.76,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,跟你走？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.76,0:20:41.47,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們才不會跟你聯手，笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.72,0:20:48.48,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我們最喜歡武士了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.65,0:20:55.78,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我就是要揍扁你，沒什麼好說的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:02.28,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.28,0:21:04.37,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,要揍扁我，是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.50,0:21:12.96,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,那就儘管放馬過來吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:16.59,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,就憑你那橫衝直撞的拳頭…{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.51,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,怎麼可能贏得了我！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:27.64,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,別太逞強！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:34.69,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,那是一種強大的力量，\N既是無形的鎧甲，也是攻擊的利器。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:38.19,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,268)}不過，只要你更進一步，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.78,0:21:41.86,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,覆蓋在你身上的霸氣\N會變得更加強大，
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.53,0:21:46.03,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,能深入對手的體內，\N從內部將他們摧毀。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:50.41,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,別太逞強！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:54.38,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,讓你體內尚未用上的霸氣\N全都灌注到拳頭上！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:21:59.26,Flashbacks-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}猿王槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:07.89,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,還是打得太淺了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.56,0:22:12.81,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,越是絕境，力量越是綻放！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:18.57,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不過挨了你那一棒之後，\N我就想通了。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.24,0:22:24.70,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你可以把霸王色霸氣\N附著到東西上，對吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.87,0:22:33.25,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,知道了這點又能幫你什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.25,0:22:35.13,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你以為你辦得到嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.55,0:22:49.35,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,唯有最強者…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.35,0:22:52.93,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,才能那樣運用它！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.93,0:22:54.73,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你這半鬼老鼠！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:56.46,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,別太逞強！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.46,0:24:00.38,Flashbacks-207+,Hyogoro,0,0,0,,讓你體內尚未用上的霸氣\N全都灌注到拳頭上！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.81,0:24:59.31,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,他根本連碰都沒碰到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.93,0:25:33.22,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,索隆…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.56,0:25:37.06,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,特拉男…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.06,0:25:41.52,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,多謝你替我殿後。
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.94,0:25:45.11,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,現在快下樓去！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.57,0:25:49.07,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,不管發生什麼事，\N我都要打倒他！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.66,0:25:57.62,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,所以你們就去吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.24,0:26:00.25,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,去告訴大家！
